      "observed": "J2 pin 4 (the fourth pin of the 1x04 FAN connector) is connected to the GND net.",
      "expected": "On a standard 4-pin fan header, pin 4 is the PWM control input and should be left unconnected (or driven by a PWM signal) when the fan is controlled by switching power; tying it to GND grounds the fan's PWM input.",
